Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:51.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《星际传奇3》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道我被放逐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know how many times{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.15,0:01:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,并自生自灭多少次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been crossed off the list and left for dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.37,0:01:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,打从一出生就开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess when it first happens the day you were born, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,数都数不清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna lose count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这种情况…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.76,0:01:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this ain't nothing new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.61,0:10:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有倒楣的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are bad days, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:11:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及无与伦比的倒楣日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then there are legendary bad days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,整座星球都想吃了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whole damn planet wanted a piece of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能抛头露面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't stay in the open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再遭到袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't risk another attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,突如其来的暗箭最难防\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always the punch you don't see coming that puts you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我为何没留意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why didn't I see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.12,0:11:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我为何没留意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why didn't I see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.83,0:11:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初他们想杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course they were gonna try to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡就是他们生存的乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death is what they do for a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.47,0:12:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以问题不是「出了什么事」\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the question ain't "What happened?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.51,0:12:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我出了什么事」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What happened to me?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是马歇尔王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the Lord Marshal now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人是怎么接近的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did they get so close?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.92,0:12:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是如何让他们攻其不备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did I let them blindside me like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,传输口 带我们到传输口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Threshold!Take us to the threshold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.35,0:12:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是死亡教派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Necromongers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.02,0:12:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人尊我为王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some wanted to put a crown on my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.77,0:12:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人则想宰了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some wanted to put a noose around my neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.65,0:13:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 想宰了我的比尊我为王的多得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, more nooses than crowns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要另谋出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed a way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.37,0:13:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,换个新环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some new place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.21,0:13:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是干脆回家乡去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe just an old one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.59,0:13:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如何发现你从未见过的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how do you find something you've never seen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.72,0:13:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回到床上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, come back to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.17,0:14:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我认为您从未睡觉 马歇尔王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I think you never sleep, Lord Marshal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.43,0:14:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在有如此多烦恼的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I sleep when I have so many…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么能够安心入睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Distractions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么如何才能了解一个男人的内心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is the best way to a man's heart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.77,0:14:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第四根肋骨和第五根肋骨之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between the fourth and fifth rib.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.36,0:14:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where I usually go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我想 我可以再那里打个结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll put a twist at the end if I wanna make sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没有信仰 他们永远不会让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll never let you stand at the threshold{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入传输口的\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Underverse without embracing the faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.46,0:14:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们来了 刺客们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they come after you, these assassins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为你变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think of you as something wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,被诅咒了 不正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cursed. Illegitimate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.22,0:14:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你生来就是那样 你会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do when you're born that way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:14:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,警卫们还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think the guards are still there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,马歇尔王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Marshal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.29,0:15:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.35,0:15:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说在第四和第五根肋骨之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said between the fourth and fifth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,第五和第六根肋骨之间 那是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifth and sixth? Body cavity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,又交到新朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making more friends, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.55,0:16:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁把她带到这的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who put her up to it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.05,0:16:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which commander?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是他们之中的任何一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be any of many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要迟疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't doubt it for a second, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦可指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Vaako.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.23,0:16:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,马歇尔王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Marshal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.61,0:16:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦可 兄弟们说你失去了勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say you lost your nerve, Vaako, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.28,0:16:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那次失手之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}after that big swing and a miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.71,0:16:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what they say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.29,0:16:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你打算如何赢回他们对你的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what are you gonna do to get that cred back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么大计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the big play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.34,0:16:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,引人注目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something splashy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想另一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had in mind something different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.28,0:17:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前发生的一次战役\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking about an early campaign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的第一次 当我还是个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My very first. I was but a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们空降到目的地 做死亡教派该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We dropped from the sky and did what Necromongers do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destruction was breathtaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.59,0:17:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们遭遇反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then we met resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对方像狮子一样凶残\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ferocious like a storm of lions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个人都干掉我们上百个兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each one of them killed over a hundred Necro{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们武器失效之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before their weapons failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.94,0:17:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又杀了30个兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they killed another 30 more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.07,0:17:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,赤手空拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barehanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:18:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于我们的火力和实力有数量上的优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our firepower and strength in numbers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终还是赢得了那场战役\N{\fnArial\fs30}eventually won us the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是常常想起他 最后那位伟大的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still see him, the last of those magnificent warriors, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在他们族人的尸骨上\N{\fnArial\fs30}standing on a pile of his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.96,0:18:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,注视着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he looked at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我永远忘不了那双眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will never forget those eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样的双眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}His eyes were just like yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.65,0:18:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个星球叫复仇星\N{\fnArial\fs30}The planet was Furya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it's called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不知道位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't know where it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要航线图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need charts. I need maps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,办不到 我需要方位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible. I need a direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道 资料都销毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purged from all records, as you well know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你记得位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you remember where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:18:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,星球太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many worlds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.39,0:19:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一仅存的地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only map left in existence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.72,0:19:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我的脑海中 瑞迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the one that's in my head, Riddick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.65,0:19:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.90,0:19:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当马歇尔王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crown?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,超凡神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transcendence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,克朗.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break off a ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞迪克 要回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riddick's going home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.93,0:19:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,超凡神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transcendence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.68,0:19:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜这是死亡教派所说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that was Necro speak for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.31,0:19:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,「永远滚出我们的飞船」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Get the fuck off our ship and make it forever."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.02,0:19:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine by me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.11,0:19:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能怪他以复仇星当诱因\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't blame him for dangling Furya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.20,0:20:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,家是无可取代的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home has a certain equity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.49,0:20:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怪他是因为后来的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do blame him for what came next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这段遥远的旅程\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long way to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.06,0:20:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,克朗 顶着张恶心的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy with the fucked-up face, Krone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该送我们回家乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was supposed to be our ride home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.86,0:20:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果复仇星没去成 反而到了一个叫做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But instead of Furya, we wind up someplace called…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.99,0:20:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,非复仇星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Furya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.75,0:20:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再次地遭人愚弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet again, someone was trying to play me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们再次地…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So yet again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.34,0:21:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为生存而杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}we play for blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.23,0:22:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡杀过必留下痕迹 瑞迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep what you kill, Riddick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.86,0:22:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡杀过必留下痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep what you kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.70,0:22:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在战斗过程中失了手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere along the way, I lost a step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.33,0:22:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,太大意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got sloppy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.71,0:22:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再身手俐落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dulled my own edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.50,0:23:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我犯下的大错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I went and did the worst crime of all…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.26,0:23:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是变得文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got civilized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.14,0:23:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在得重头开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now we zero the clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.85,0:23:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪我的就只有这个无名世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just me and this no-name world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.03,0:23:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得找回我野蛮的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta find that animal side again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.83,0:25:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了没多久 我就发现这里别有洞天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before long, I realized there was a whole other world over there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.13,0:25:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有水 有植物 有生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}of water, grass and life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.43,0:25:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是有个东西很碍事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just had one thing in my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.09,0:26:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.67,0:29:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快来咬我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, show me some teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.25,0:30:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很会逃是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Escape artist, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.37,0:33:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吃什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got over there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.13,0:33:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有福同享不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought we shared everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.58,0:33:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,吐出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.26,0:34:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.34,0:35:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,赏金猎人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bounty hunters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.23,0:35:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.23,0:35:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.36,0:35:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.74,0:36:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 可以吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.91,0:36:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.50,0:36:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.59,0:36:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.84,0:36:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.43,0:36:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面是写狗食\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says "dog food" on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.64,0:36:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你看得懂的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could read.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.82,0:36:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.12,0:36:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 把储备食物拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Bring me my reserve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.30,0:37:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.46,0:37:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要下雨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.33,0:37:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.13,0:37:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没见过不代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because you've never seen it before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.46,0:37:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean it's a bad thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.47,0:37:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿… 别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.98,0:38:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们得离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like our time is up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.40,0:38:05.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（紧急信号）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.00,0:38:16.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（扫描中）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.80,0:38:20.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（P7佣兵站紧急信号已启动）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.50,0:38:22.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发现一名生还者…）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.80,0:38:24.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（理查雷迪克 谋杀罪逃犯）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.80,0:38:27.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（取回首级赏金双倍）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.40,0:40:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.02,0:40:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,再巡一次 迪亚兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look again, Diaz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.00,0:40:08.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（留一艘太空船然后滚 否则要你的命）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.53,0:40:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,教教 瑞迪克 这混球算数吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody should teach this Riddick asshole how to count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.82,0:40:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,留一艘太空船 好像我们还有一艘备用似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Leave one ship"? Like we've got a fucking spare laying around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.79,0:40:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备扎营吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's crank it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.30,0:40:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 独眼龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Cyclops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.37,0:40:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 卢纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Luna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.37,0:41:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.00,0:41:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫她起来 踹她下床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake her up, kick her out of bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.17,0:41:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.00,0:41:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空船太重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're running heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.96,0:41:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是囚犯 不是要用她来抵回程旅费吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a prisoner. Wasn't she gonna pay our way back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.59,0:41:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快超载了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going big now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.72,0:41:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗 要减60公斤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Cut that 60 kilos loose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.49,0:41:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 不要碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away! Get away from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.11,0:41:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫 不要吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, just stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.66,0:41:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.41,0:41:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你解开镣铐 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take off the restraints. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.00,0:41:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want them off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.29,0:41:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想歪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.37,0:41:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会碰你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody is gonna touch you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.46,0:41:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑塔纳 有别的事要忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santana's head is into other stuff now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.84,0:41:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lucky day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.22,0:41:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别他妈的碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the fuck away from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.68,0:42:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.14,0:42:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么星球 我们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What planet is this? Where are we{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.23,0:42:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有氧气和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got air and water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.02,0:42:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这些就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you've got to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.86,0:42:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这要怎么活 快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how am I supposed to survive… Just go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.20,0:42:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得他改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he changes his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.56,0:42:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才刚喜欢上她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was getting attached to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.48,0:42:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的箱子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now where is my box at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.42,0:43:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫 桑塔纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name is Santana!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.67,0:43:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这帮人的老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shot-caller for this crew right here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.68,0:43:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这个人无所不知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the guy who knows all, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.64,0:43:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都见过 什么都不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}sees all, beats all…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.64,0:43:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还蛮会呛声的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spitting it kind of strong, ain't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.15,0:43:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在诱敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to bait the trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.36,0:43:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我特地拿箱子来装你的首级\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come all this way to collect your head in a box!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.95,0:43:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就装在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.03,0:43:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好享受今天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So have yourself a fine day now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.24,0:43:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德·B·瑞迪克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Richard B. Riddick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.37,0:43:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估计…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suspect{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.87,0:43:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天便是你的死期\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will be one of your very last!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.67,0:43:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,和 瑞迪克 呛声没用啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you don't need to agitate Riddick any more than, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.22,0:44:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要带着他的脑袋回去就好是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any more than bringing his head back in a box would?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.95,0:44:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌 抢饭碗的人又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Here comes the neighborhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.05,0:44:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界真小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.76,0:44:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来路不明的太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unidentified vessel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.06,0:44:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是Ursa五号星的Vagos帮派\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is Clan Vagos out of Ursa Five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.89,0:44:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收到了紧急信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be advised that we are on the ground now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.10,0:44:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前已登陆这个星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have responded to an emergency signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.61,0:44:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么事 不用降落了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No distress found, no need to land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.74,0:45:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,重覆 你们不必登陆这个星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, there is no reason for you to land at this location at this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.78,0:45:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that clear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.12,0:45:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不必登陆这个星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reason for you to land at this location at this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.79,0:45:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的听不懂人话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck did I just say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.50,0:45:16.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（留一艘太空船然后滚 否则要你的命）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.48,0:45:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这趟旅程很长 我们可以补充些水\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a long haul. We could take on some water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.11,0:45:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受一下地心引力也不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't mind a little true-gravity time either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.98,0:45:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了 我可以搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I was saying, I've got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.83,0:45:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道发紧急信号的是谁吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew who that was, right? On the emergency beacon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.71,0:45:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道就不会来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't be here if I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.09,0:45:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来支援还不高兴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The concept of back-up still has no appeal to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.21,0:46:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手下能搞定任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My besties here can ball with anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.30,0:46:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是说你们喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No disrespect for your crew, of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.18,0:46:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的制服看起来挺炫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who look strong, too, in those matchy-matchy outfits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.35,0:46:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了 我不知道有主题服装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Didn't know there was a dress code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.18,0:46:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.52,0:46:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意要踩你的线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not my intention to jump another man's claim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.19,0:46:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不介意 我们拉张椅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't mind, maybe we'll just pull up a chair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.86,0:46:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在旁边观赏一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}and spectate for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.19,0:46:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果介意呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.20,0:46:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 这是公用太空站 任何佣兵都能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is a co-op station, pal. It's open to all Mercs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.99,0:46:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我叫做… 太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, my name is… "Too late."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.70,0:46:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就叫「太迟了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your name."Too Late."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.54,0:46:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不让你进来搅局\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't need you stepping all over my dick here, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.38,0:46:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如这样好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll tell you what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.05,0:46:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不出手 除非你找我帮忙 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't lift a finger to help until you come ask me for it. How's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.36,0:47:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前勘查过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was scoping this out earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.40,0:47:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,南方五公里处有岩洞群\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cave system. Five clicks south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.07,0:47:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be worth a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.58,0:47:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Too Late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.66,0:47:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拆一个燃料夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to pull a node from your ship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.41,0:47:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我的放在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}and store it right here next to mine. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.25,0:47:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Why is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.83,0:47:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞迪克 为了逃才启动信号 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riddick triggered the beacon to get off-world, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.88,0:47:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上 他是在叫计程车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, he was calling a taxi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.68,0:47:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.43,0:47:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空船正好用来当陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a ship would make a sweet trap, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.35,0:47:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,封闭空间 铜墙铁壁 像监狱一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confined space, metal walls, jail cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.77,0:47:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,很酷吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is cool, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.19,0:47:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是真的常遇到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true half the people you meet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.94,0:47:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,智障\N{\fnArial\fs30}are below average intelligence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.69,0:47:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,得准备好等他来 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to make sure the ship stays grounded when he comes for them, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.57,0:47:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.70,0:47:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,达尔 拆一个燃料夹下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dahl, pull a node from the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.27,0:48:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.43,0:48:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.52,0:48:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.52,0:48:37.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警告 会向外爆炸）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.00,0:48:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就等你了 瑞迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any time now, Riddick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.69,0:49:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 根本是瓮中捉鳖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, this is total overkill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.78,0:49:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出动了11个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Eleven of us out here now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.19,0:49:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,顶多四个人就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have been a four-man op, tops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.91,0:49:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,少在那里触霉头 这样很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are jinxing our janx, man. And that ain't cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.87,0:49:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管别人怎么说 他才一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I don't give a shit what they say. He's one guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.58,0:49:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you say, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.17,0:49:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.17,0:49:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.10,0:49:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能在一颗月亮下这样杀时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess that's what passes for a fucking moon on this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.35,0:49:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上会很暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a dark night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.98,0:49:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对他有利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advantage, him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.86,0:49:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他想削减你的体力 逼着你不能睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's gonna wear you down first. Force you to go without sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.95,0:49:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看到我在忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you see I'm busy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.78,0:49:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是分享意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just sharing my thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.95,0:50:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你分享完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now that you have, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.37,0:50:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以礼貌地\N{\fnArial\fs30}can I politely invite you to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.71,0:50:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你滚蛋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}step off my fucking porch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.80,0:50:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去准备关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll start rotating down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.80,0:50:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事就叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me know, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.30,0:50:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一拿到他的脑袋就会跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I have his head in a box, I will let you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.54,0:50:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,29D区 请待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grid 29D. Stand by, stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.84,0:50:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,表哥 你看到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got, cuz?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.34,0:50:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只像狗的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aha, some dingo-dongo thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.43,0:51:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我也看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I see it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.35,0:51:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要射杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to pop it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.52,0:51:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一枪解决 用灭音器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock it down. One shot suppressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.15,0:51:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 迪亚兹 真是振奋士气啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, Diaz. Encouraging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.65,0:51:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛被东西挡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had something in my eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.41,0:51:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那叫瞄准镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a scope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.53,0:51:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次记得用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try next time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.49,0:51:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞得定吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.16,0:51:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别占用我的频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you get off my freaking frequency!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.56,0:51:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.50,0:52:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈感谢主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank fucking God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.01,0:52:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.05,0:52:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢比奥 我现在要过去 得更换故障的感应器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rubio, coming your way now. Gotta swap out a bad sensor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.98,0:52:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,登记的和目前库存的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was here versus what was found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.81,0:52:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有出入吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does it square?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.57,0:52:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都很好 吗啡没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty good. I mean, the morphine's gone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.48,0:52:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都是这个先用完\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's always the first thing to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.95,0:52:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里挺奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a bit weird, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.91,0:52:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,42英吋的利齿捕兽夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A predator restraint with 42-inch offset jaws."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.49,0:52:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,原本有六个 全没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six listed, zero found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.41,0:52:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见这些还挺怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is an odd thing to go for a walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.12,0:52:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过太空站常有东西被偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, Boss, you know how shit goes missing from these stations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.96,0:52:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一不景气就有人偷东西变卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}One bad year and guys are ripping shit off for salvage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.51,0:53:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 桑塔纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Santana?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.77,0:53:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来之前你有搜查过这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did sweep the area before I got here, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.60,0:53:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜查什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweep for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.60,0:53:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想确定没人设陷阱陷害我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to make sure no one has set any traps for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.94,0:53:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查5Q区\N{\fnArial\fs30}5Q.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.11,0:53:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂我的意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand what I'm saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.95,0:53:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,陷阱 什么样的陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traps? What kind of traps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.57,0:53:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有利齿的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kind with jaws.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.29,0:53:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰那个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch that fucking thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.38,0:53:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.64,0:53:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,护胸盔甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up-armor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.52,0:53:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.90,0:53:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备出动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready. Ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.03,0:54:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay put, stay put, stay put, stay put!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.00,0:54:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oopah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.88,0:54:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那里鬼吼鬼叫啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell was that screaming and why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.42,0:54:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,努涅斯 带扫描探测器来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nunez, break out the sweep gear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.76,0:54:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出外面还有多少这种大陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And figure out how many of these big-ass traps{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.26,0:54:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}we got out here, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.35,0:54:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞不好左上半边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking maybe the whole upper left quad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.85,0:54:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是陷阱区\N{\fnArial\fs30}is some kind of fucking mine field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.69,0:54:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快去 听到没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to do that now, okay, Nunez?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.94,0:54:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,努涅斯 听到没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that, Nunez?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.24,0:54:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,努涅斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nunez?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.87,0:54:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,惨了 情况很不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bad. This is very bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.62,0:54:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,努涅斯？努涅斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nunez? Nunez?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.04,0:54:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the fuck up, puto!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.54,0:55:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的对讲机坏了 看着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}His radio just crapped out. Someone get eyes on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.55,0:55:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他回13H区 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure he's right where he should be, 13-H. Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.89,0:55:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.06,0:55:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,13H区 他应该在这里才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}13-H. He's supposed to be right fucking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.73,0:55:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫瓮中捉鳖 还嫌11个人太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this was overkill, huh? Eleven of us, too many. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.28,0:55:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很了解 瑞迪克 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know all about Riddick, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.36,0:55:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你应该收回那句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe you need to take that shit back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.33,0:55:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,收回触霉头的话 懂了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the jinx off our janx. You understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.00,0:55:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,法尔科 那才是你该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you need to do, Falco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.75,0:55:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得收回那句倒楣话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to unjinxelate our fucking janx!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.67,0:55:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在别搞我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mess with me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.93,0:55:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, what is it? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.10,0:55:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back! It's me, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.35,0:55:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了法尔科\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got Falco!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.61,0:56:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备应战 你们俩留守\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jock up, but you're staying home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.78,0:56:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没我的命令 谁都不准出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's going out there until I say so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.78,0:56:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,人员阵亡 他杀了法尔科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man down, he's got Falco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.07,0:56:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,被发现了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compromise, compromise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.32,0:56:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么办到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the fuck did he do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.41,0:56:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他站在这 而我却没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never ever saw him, man. He was right here and I never…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.49,0:56:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太空船呢 他在上面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the ship? Is he on it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.58,0:56:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的目标不是太空船 是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not coming for the ships, he's coming for fucking us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.75,0:56:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just fucking shoot! Shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.59,0:56:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一晚就死了三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One night, three dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.05,0:56:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样下去可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure I'm loving this trend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.47,0:56:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是两死一失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two dead, one missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.76,0:56:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 死了三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. Three dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.31,0:56:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,换个方式来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at it this way, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.31,0:56:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家刚好可以挤一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might all fit on one ship now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.23,0:56:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪亚兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diaz!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.99,0:56:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,把其他陷阱都拿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get those other traps back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.49,0:56:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢纳 替他们祷告一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luna, say something Bible-like over these bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.88,0:57:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, maybe, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.34,0:57:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该重新来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}we zero this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.22,0:57:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your tag anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.35,0:57:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于想知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you wanna know my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.02,0:57:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定该不该讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not sure I'm gonna say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.98,0:57:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为被你知道名字的都挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because everyone you know by name, Santana, winds up dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.19,0:57:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要打扫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna clean this shit up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.20,0:57:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.33,0:57:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心被偷袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out for surprise attacks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.38,0:57:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.21,0:57:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们应该同心协力了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's time to start merging assets, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.72,0:57:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你在找我帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is you asking for my help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.05,0:57:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是需要你的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is me saying that I may need some of your gear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.22,0:58:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的人必须跟着武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}If some of your guys happen to come attached to that gear, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.65,0:58:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解 反正就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will understand that's the way it's gotta be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.19,0:58:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你只是要借武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're asking for my gear's help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.86,0:58:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你只是要借武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.36,0:58:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moss…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.71,0:58:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器说「不要」 很难搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gear's saying, "Nah." Bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.00,0:58:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's your answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.59,0:58:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck do you want, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.84,0:58:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 我让你加入我们 桑塔纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'm gonna fold you in, Santana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.55,0:58:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 达尔 听命于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I give orders to Dahl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.67,0:58:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你则听命于 达尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Dahl's gonna give orders to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.76,0:58:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后的指挥链就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the chain of command from this point forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.22,0:58:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么好像不太满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I not loving this plan so far?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.10,0:58:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂了… 你知道原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know, I know. You know why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.86,0:58:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这样子很鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it sucks ass and swallows!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.90,0:58:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不听你那小婊子的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not taking orders from your pet whore{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.49,0:58:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还以为我不敢还手\N{\fnArial\fs30}who thinks I won't smack her right back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.74,0:58:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不搞男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't fuck guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.41,0:59:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但遇到欠搞的 我会搞死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Occasionally I fuck 'em up if they need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.58,0:59:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划是这样的 桑塔纳 你先在这待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what's gonna happen, Santana. You're gonna take a back seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.09,0:59:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证会逮到瑞迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll track Riddick down, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.46,0:59:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要留活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want him alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.38,0:59:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一天时间 之后他随你处置\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me a day, and after that he's yours to kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.89,0:59:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把赏金让给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're giving me the bounty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.72,0:59:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,扣掉团员薪资和燃料费 剩下的归你 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pay my crew, fuel costs, the rest is yours. That's the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.39,0:59:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找 瑞迪克 干嘛 他可不是一般罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is Riddick for you? Not just some convict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.94,0:59:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的目的何在 你为什么来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want? Why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.98,0:59:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.49,0:59:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Johns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.16,0:59:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁太空船 把气垫车移到甲板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock down those ships, get those hogs on deck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.53,0:59:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟莫斯和拉克斯波坐一台\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will ride with Moss and Lockspur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.53,0:59:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只准带非致命性电击枪和白磷手榴弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a non-lethal load-out, L.O.D.'s and phosphor frags to start with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.83,0:59:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个在夜晚狩猎的人 我们则要在白天行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a man that hunts by night. We'll take it to him by day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.09,0:59:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪亚兹 瓦格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diaz! Vargas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.82,0:59:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去上一个人被杀的地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me the spot of the last kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.80,0:59:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是某种狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of canine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.32,1:00:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 迪亚兹 发现一只狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Diaz, I got a dog here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.24,1:00:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是昨晚那只吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it the same dingo-dongo thing from last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.66,1:00:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 那只被我们杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I'm pretty sure we killed that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.79,1:00:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是同一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be the same one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.87,1:00:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是同一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.04,1:00:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,达尔 用狙击枪和钡弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dahl, get your sniper rifle and barium rounds now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.56,1:00:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离一千五百米\N{\fnArial\fs30}1, 500 meters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.84,1:02:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可能只是看到洞就躲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be just the first hole it found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.47,1:02:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物受惊吓会躲到熟悉的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}A stressed animal is gonna run to ground it knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.14,1:02:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,此外 这里有人类的费洛蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I'm getting human pheromones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.39,1:03:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riddick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.98,1:03:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dial down, dial down, dial down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.99,1:03:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是桑塔纳的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santana's guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.37,1:03:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,法尔科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.45,1:03:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 我们杀了人质吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Did we just kill a hostage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.50,1:03:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我整整找了瑞迪克十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been hunting Riddick for 10 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.54,1:04:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不玩人质这一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}The concept of a hostage has no appeal to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.42,1:04:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,法尔科 早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falco was already dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.80,1:04:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是用这招来拖时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just some fucking sideshow to buy more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.59,1:04:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Fuck…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.68,1:04:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.44,1:04:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是出师不利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just dropped some mud right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.44,1:04:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果瑞迪克不在这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if Riddick isn't here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.98,1:05:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,达尔 听得到吗 有人听到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dahl? Dahl, do you copy? Does anyone copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.57,1:05:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,达尔 你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dahl, you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.00,1:06:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.09,1:06:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在对我抛媚眼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you just perving out on me somehow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.84,1:06:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 祝你心想事成\N{\fnArial\fs30}May all your dreams come true, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.35,1:06:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你两分钟 到外面站岗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got two minutes. I want you out on fucking watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.61,1:06:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luna!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.82,1:06:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看着我 掩护我 那才是你来的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't watch me. Watch my back. That's what you're here for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.53,1:06:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,向前走两步 我说两步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take two steps forward. Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.51,1:06:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 他神出鬼没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, he could be anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.48,1:07:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是约翰 站内的人快回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Johns to any-goddamn-body at the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.44,1:07:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们看好置物柜 看好燃料夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to keep an eye on that locker. Keep an eye on the node.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.98,1:07:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞迪克 可能会用欺敌战术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riddick may have made an end run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.99,1:07:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概七分钟后到 大家小心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ETA is seven minutes. But watch your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.50,1:08:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,小贱人 你跑去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you little bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.50,1:08:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分钟到了 你到底要不要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your two minutes are up. You gonna do what I tell you to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.34,1:08:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说瑞迪克在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumor is Riddick might be in the vicinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.18,1:08:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该检查一下置物柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I should just check on the locker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.39,1:08:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,去外面 戴上夜视镜 然后找出那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outside, get on your optics, and get after this fucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.52,1:08:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna find him here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.58,1:08:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 达尔 我觉得我们挺像的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, Dahl, I think we have something in common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.75,1:08:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不搞男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't fuck guys either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.96,1:09:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.00,1:09:41.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一物换一物）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.43,1:09:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他写的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wrote that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.64,1:09:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他破坏了整个通讯系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took out our deep space communications. All of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.81,1:09:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁的血 那边有 这边也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whose blood is that? There… Here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.82,1:09:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.78,1:10:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非得再扁他一顿 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to kick his ass again. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.87,1:10:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.09,1:10:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.59,1:10:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们来检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.19,1:10:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.11,1:10:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把钥匙有离开过你的脖子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That key leave your neck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.57,1:10:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.99,1:10:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一物换一物的唯一可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the only reason to write "fair trade"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.61,1:10:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他拿了柜内的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}is if he got into that locker and he took something out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.74,1:10:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要的东西 例如燃料夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that we need, like a power node, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.20,1:10:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再交换他要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}which he could then swap for something he needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.25,1:10:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么费功\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that? Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.13,1:10:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能性很低\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highly unlikely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.17,1:11:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你解释一下 桑塔纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me join the fucking dots for you, Santana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.22,1:11:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的推论 如果他真的打开过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what I'm saying. If he did get in there somehow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.01,1:11:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绝对能重锁并更改密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was in a position to relock it and change the code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.39,1:11:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码可能改掉了 桑塔纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be entering the wrong shit, Santana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.56,1:11:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.27,1:11:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为在几个小时内\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you think sometime during the last few hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.45,1:11:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他偷拿走我脖子上的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}he got this off my neck without me noticing, {\r}
