Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.95,1:18:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 暴风雨快来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It's coming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.79,1:18:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们干脆合并燃料夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then we just combine nodes.{\r}
