Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.12,1:20:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.24,1:20:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲低点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.08,1:20:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.60,1:20:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you drop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.13,1:21:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人头值多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the bounty at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.46,1:21:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道也不在乎 这不是我来的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I don't care. It's not why I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.30,1:21:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个大智障肯定知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet the big jamoke knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.80,1:21:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我知道确切金额\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I know exactly what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.97,1:21:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道带人头回去是双倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do know is that it's double if you're brought back dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.35,1:21:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒没听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.31,1:21:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,够支付你们的葬礼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it be enough to pay for your funerals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.86,1:21:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有兴趣的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm interested in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.15,1:21:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,编号M344/G那个荒僻星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a little backwater place with a system code M-344/G.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.49,1:21:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道十年前发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know what happened there 10 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.33,1:21:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.67,1:22:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big Daddy Johns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.17,1:22:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.84,1:22:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大老远跑来就为了找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you traveled all this way just to see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.80,1:22:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受宠若惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm flattered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.56,1:22:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,族谱不知道怎么写\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of strange not knowing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.68,1:22:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,总觉得怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}what to put down in the family bible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.89,1:22:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此牺牲三条命也蛮奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of strange three guys have to die just so that you can hear…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.06,1:22:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不… 别把他们的死算在我头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You don't get to put that shit on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.48,1:22:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都得指向你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those kills are on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.53,1:22:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有预感「指」向我的不止这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a feeling that's not the only thing on me right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.40,1:22:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我有钡弹 电击弹 爆裂弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, got barium shells, stab-shock, explosive tip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.37,1:22:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选哪一个 钡弹还是电击弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, barium or stab-shock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.08,1:22:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物麻醉针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horse tranq.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.25,1:22:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.54,1:22:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想打扰你们讨论八百年前的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to interrupt this discussion about ancient history, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.17,1:22:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我应该过来自我介绍一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}but maybe I should step in right here and introduce myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.55,1:22:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的大名是… 箱子男\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is… Box Boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.55,1:22:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.06,1:23:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你想把我的头装进箱子吧 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the guy who said that he was gonna put my head in a box. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.69,1:23:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛… 是我… 碎碎念而已啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was me spitting noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.23,1:23:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你真的有带箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you do have a box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.24,1:23:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有… 箱子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have a box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.11,1:23:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像有看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I saw one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.41,1:23:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然有带箱子 老兄 每个人都有带箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, of course I've got a box. Everyone's got a box, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.95,1:23:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,连迪亚兹都有个超大的箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Diaz has a fucking huge box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.58,1:23:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.92,1:23:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会用得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.42,1:23:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个挂了 剩八个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three down, eight left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.43,1:23:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常我会继续杀下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, normally I'd just keep going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.93,1:23:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个挂了… 再来是九个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six down… Nine down…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.43,1:23:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get where I'm going with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.77,1:23:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在情况不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}But things are changing here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.48,1:23:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人想在这待超过24小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nobody wants to be on this planet 24 hours from now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.28,1:23:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我建议大家有志一同\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I suggest we make it work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.95,1:23:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要来个君子协定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, a gentleman's agreement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.03,1:23:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放一个燃料夹在外面 你去拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave one node out in the open. You take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.95,1:24:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的燃料和另一艘船归我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other node and the other ship are mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.29,1:24:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.54,1:24:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在在玩什么游戏 智障宾果吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we playing here, retard bingo? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.34,1:24:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始就是这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was on the table from the start…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.34,1:24:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管一开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.34,1:24:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该关心的是结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the end you want to think about now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.68,1:24:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.02,1:24:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你考虑到雨下到太空站\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you till that rain hits that station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.36,1:24:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己注意时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.74,1:24:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,箱子男…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Box Boy"…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.22,1:24:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,达尔 快开枪 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dahl! Do it now! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.69,1:25:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.03,1:25:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会昏倒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.42,1:25:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续射 达尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it again, Dahl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.21,1:25:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这不就昏倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.52,1:26:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来 达尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this, Dahl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.39,1:27:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riddick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.93,1:27:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞迪克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riddick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.48,1:27:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johns?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.03,1:27:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开始用链子打俘虏了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We beating men in chains now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.91,1:27:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 从最早说起 先说明一下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, from the beginning. For the historical record…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.50,1:27:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gratzner 猎人号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hunter Gratzner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.67,1:27:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子就是用这艘商用飞行舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the commercial vessel my son uses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.09,1:27:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,运送你回监狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to transport you back to the slammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.50,1:27:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那艘船却在M344/G附近发出求救讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that ship sends a distress call somewhere near M-344/G.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.38,1:27:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个荒僻的星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a backwater system, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.68,1:27:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个太阳和一个适合人居住的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}with two suns, one habitable planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.18,1:27:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有在坠机中存活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he survive the crash?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.35,1:27:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后几小时出现了很戏剧化的发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big drama the next few hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.52,1:27:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过无论发生什么事 不管他们说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whatever happens, no matter what they tell you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.69,1:28:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,都千万别让他们松绑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't let 'em take these chains off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.61,1:28:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他们」 谁是「他们」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them? Who's "them"? Who are you talking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.16,1:28:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你在跟谁说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who you're talking to here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.12,1:28:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在瞪我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.04,1:28:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦解开这些手铐…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the chains come off…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.54,1:28:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有完没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.71,1:28:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,箱子男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Box Boy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.71,1:28:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,五秒内你先死\N{\fnArial\fs30}you go in the first five seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.26,1:28:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.55,1:28:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么杀 打嘴炮吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you plan on killing me with what, your mouth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.02,1:28:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,用那把金光闪闪的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shiny blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.64,1:28:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒想见识一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to see you try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.82,1:28:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,先说明一下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the historical record, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.74,1:28:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他存活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.24,1:28:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你们两个存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's just you and him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.16,1:28:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,原本有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was, uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.58,1:28:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟这里差不多的人数\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the same number you see here in this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.96,1:29:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少人逃出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how many made it off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.67,1:29:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.43,1:29:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.76,1:29:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.60,1:29:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以在坠机和你离开前这段时间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So between the time of the crash and the time you leave that planet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.85,1:29:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}my son dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.77,1:29:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以有把握地假设是你杀的 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can safely assume it's at your hands. Is that right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.28,1:29:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在浪费他妈的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm wasting my fucking time here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.37,1:29:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任何临终遗愿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You grant any last wishes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.12,1:29:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was referring to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.00,1:29:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是手铐不性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that the chains aren't a hot look, but no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.63,1:29:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要在他们面前骑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna straddle you in front of all these guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.34,1:29:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我先杀了他们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I killed all of 'em first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.56,1:29:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.73,1:29:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻醉药还有一大堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot more tranq where that came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.48,1:30:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,达尔 告诉我窗外有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you see outside that window, Dahl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.49,1:30:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,独眼龙装备 两艘太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyclops unit, two ships, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.04,1:30:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有几具装袋的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}couple dead guys in plastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.00,1:30:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看到其他东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't see anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.88,1:30:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.88,1:30:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到时通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know when you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.84,1:30:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的指甲很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love those toenails, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.35,1:30:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.14,1:30:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,侵略系粉红色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Predator Pink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.85,1:30:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的乳头很搭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matches your nipples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.52,1:30:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们干嘛听这个大淫虫废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we even listening to this big fuckstick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.19,1:30:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以拜托直接砍了他的头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just detach his head, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.07,1:30:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what's gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.86,1:30:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的60秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next 60 seconds, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.03,1:30:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的头会被装进那个箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna watch your own head drop into that box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.91,1:30:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.91,1:30:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都阻止不了你下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing is gonna keep you from that special place in hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.67,1:31:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许死前的最后一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe in the last minute of your life, you want to be something more{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.71,1:31:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以他妈的文明点\N{\fnArial\fs30}than a goddamn savage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.88,1:31:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好回答我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimme some fucking answers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.01,1:31:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.56,1:31:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讲的你有要补充什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything you'd like to add on the subject I just raised?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.88,1:31:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.59,1:31:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间的确到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time is up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.76,1:31:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.44,1:32:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,压住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.64,1:32:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是更多狗来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More dingo-dongos maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.86,1:32:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.53,1:32:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.82,1:32:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你叫来的 这群蛇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Called to find you. The serpents…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.35,1:33:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,打灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spotlight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.71,1:33:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.50,1:33:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们该怕的不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}it ain't me you gotta worry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.47,1:34:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西 外面有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What's out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.18,1:34:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.47,1:34:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是可怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucked up or something out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.60,1:34:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太对劲 朝我们过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't right. It's coming our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.07,1:34:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么东西 其实没那么难解决嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever they are, they ain't so hard to kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.20,1:35:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.76,1:35:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.32,1:35:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托别再开洞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more holes, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.36,1:36:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now here's what's gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.15,1:36:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的60秒 你们要松绑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 60 seconds you're gonna take these chains off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.45,1:36:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要取回燃料夹然后离开这个星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make a play for those nodes and get off this rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.32,1:36:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果在过程中… 情况变得很糟时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But somewhere along the line, when it gets really bad, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.96,1:36:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johns{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.00,1:36:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会像他儿子一样认输\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna fold just like Little Johns did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.01,1:36:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一切结束后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then when it's all over{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.80,1:36:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们剩下的人就等着被捡尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the rest of you are ready for Dead Animal Pickup, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.89,1:36:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会好好地「深入」达尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go balls deep into Dahl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.48,1:36:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只因为她请我这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only because she asked me to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.31,1:36:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,用她的「甜嘴」问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet-like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.61,1:37:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,「情况变糟」是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he mean, "When things go bad"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.70,1:37:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样还不算糟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? This doesn't qualify as bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.57,1:37:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在到底是怎样 状况到底有多糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is happening? How fucked are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.08,1:37:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道雨会下多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows how long it will rain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.08,1:37:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是我杀了多少只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or just how many of them are buried out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.25,1:37:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的眼睛看得一清二楚 却什么也不讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw it. He saw it with those eyes of his and he didn't tell us what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.31,1:37:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘船归你 一艘船归我\N{\fnArial\fs30}One ship for you, one for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.31,1:37:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要确定能取回燃料夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know that these nodes are retrievable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.11,1:37:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我要确定我们一言为定\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need to know we have a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.95,1:37:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一言为定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.96,1:38:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chains stay on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.39,1:38:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们旁观吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we sit this one out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.31,1:38:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.32,1:38:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up, up, up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.28,1:38:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good doggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.51,1:38:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.53,1:39:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妈呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.03,1:39:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.37,1:39:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是放了他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's cut him loose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.50,1:39:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,只花了五秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was five seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.12,1:39:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向说话算话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to be a man of my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.17,1:39:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you, Johns?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.34,1:40:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝将派天使保护我 让我永远活在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For He shall give His angels charge over me, keep me in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.39,1:40:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的恩典中 闭嘴啦 卢纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}all His grace as long as I live. Shut the noise, Luna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.39,1:40:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得天使来保护我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think the angels are here protecting me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.10,1:40:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们在这里看守我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they're here, watchin' over me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.86,1:40:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许会带我们离开… 这个鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe they'll deliver us all from this crazy, evil place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.90,1:40:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在那里吓人 给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shit is creeping everybody out, so shut the fuck up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.61,1:40:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才闭嘴 别凶那个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shut the fuck up, Vargas. Leave the kid alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.37,1:40:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里跑来的 我的老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did that… Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.46,1:40:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别射…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.38,1:40:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,死疯子 你有什么毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is wrong with you, you crazy bastard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.13,1:40:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have killed me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.47,1:40:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,射中了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it, didn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.39,1:41:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦格斯 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vargas, get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.81,1:41:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦格斯 快起来 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vargas, get up. Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.27,1:41:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦格斯 快点 小伤而已 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vargas, come on, man. Walk it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.98,1:41:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是小只的而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. It's just a little one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.86,1:41:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小只的最恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small ones are the worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.40,1:41:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的毒液最多\N{\fnArial\fs30}They save the most venom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.46,1:41:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And kid, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.96,1:41:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别烦上帝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}leave God out of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.13,1:41:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的事他才不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants no part of what happens next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.98,1:41:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘了跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot to mention, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.52,1:41:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不准用武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no weapons for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.99,1:42:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会骑这种车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can ride one of these things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.54,1:42:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早在无数关头玩过命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ride it like I stole it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.18,1:42:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我骑旁边掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take flank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.69,1:42:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果 瑞迪克 独自回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Riddick comes back here without us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.94,1:42:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就照基本原则杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}you go ahead, you kill him on general principle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.32,1:42:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在我该干他之前或之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that before or after I'm supposed to fuck him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.56,1:45:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混帐王八蛋 只会在旁边看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asshole motherfucker! Just sittin' there watchin'!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.56,1:45:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原本可以掩护你 但你说 「不准用武器」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would have covered you, but you said, "No weapons."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.65,1:45:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有多想要那些燃料夹 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad you want those nodes, Johns?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.32,1:46:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该没有像这样安葬他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose you took the time to do this for him, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.78,1:46:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会感到很震惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may come as a shock to you, Johns, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.95,1:46:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我并没杀你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't ghost your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.08,1:46:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该是自杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seemed set on killin' himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.01,1:46:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.63,1:46:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morphine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.64,1:46:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子吗啡上瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son liked his morphine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.56,1:46:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天打两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liked it twice a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.35,1:46:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道自己儿子是毒虫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't know your son was a junkie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.36,1:46:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小约翰 跟其他佣兵一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johns was like most Mercs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.07,1:46:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来勇敢又正直\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look all stand-up and do-right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.07,1:46:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,深入了解后才发现有东西没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you cut them open and you find something missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.91,1:46:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就他来说 他没种\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his case, a spine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.91,1:46:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要听这些屁话 这不是我认识的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to listen to this shit! That's not the man I knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.33,1:47:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你不了解你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you didn't know your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.80,1:47:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为了活命…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to kill a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.43,1:47:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想牺牲小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To save his own skin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.85,1:47:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我很不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a problem with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.43,1:47:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You expect me to believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.93,1:47:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子会为求自保而杀小孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}my son was gonna kill a child to save his own life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.23,1:47:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,吗啡让人意志薄弱 失去良知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morphine makes the brain soft. Heart weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.61,1:47:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死都不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't fuckin' buy it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.03,1:47:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信我儿子是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't believe that my son's the bad guy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.33,1:47:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你编出来的胡言乱语\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this fuckin' demented fairy tale of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.25,1:47:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没理由骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reason to lie now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.09,1:47:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.63,1:47:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们有一方坦承\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.29,1:48:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你帮我杀了其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for startin'the killing spree for me, Riddick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.83,1:48:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的我来就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll take it from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.35,1:49:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,大智障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jamoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.64,1:49:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你埋藏那把刀是为了杀我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that blade you buried was meant for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.11,1:49:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要是该死的就杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone who deserved it, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.99,1:49:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题大了 瑞迪克，\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a problem, Riddick, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.28,1:49:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这里有两个燃料夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I've got two nodes here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.91,1:49:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只有一辆飙骑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got one hog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.95,1:49:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我死都不要再坐你后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I sure as shit am not ridin' bitch with you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.34,1:49:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆飙骑\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hog?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.13,1:49:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that, Johns?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.89,1:50:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把涡轮针拔掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He pulled the goddamn turbine pin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.93,1:50:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在才发现啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just figured that out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.56,1:50:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪亚兹 原本想拿了燃料夹就杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diaz was gonna take the nodes for himself and ghost me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.52,1:50:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打算弃你而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was gonna leave you out here alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.69,1:50:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.58,1:50:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也只能徒步行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we switch to our ground game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.58,1:50:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧是不是「犬子无虎父」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if that lack o spine runs in the family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.93,1:51:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,再上膛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reload!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.48,1:51:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.53,1:51:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.91,1:53:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got inbound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.34,1:54:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.26,1:54:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it just you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.89,1:54:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快装进去 看还能不能用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just slam this thing in. See if it's still good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.60,1:54:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.68,1:54:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看那鬼东西能不能用就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just see if the fucking thing works!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.05,1:54:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.56,1:58:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十秒之内撤离 动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extraction, 30 seconds or less. Let's go, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.72,1:59:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要问你一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you somethin', {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.76,1:59:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我的甜嘴问\N{\fnArial\fs30}sweet-like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.26,1:59:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞迪克 这一趟死了不少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of good men died here, Riddick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.52,1:59:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次我还是会不知道该不该逮捕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure how I'm supposed to overlook that. Next time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.81,1:59:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 要不是他们想把我的头装在箱子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Things would have been different{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.94,1:59:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果本来会不一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they weren't trying to put my head in a box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.99,2:00:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞迪克 你现在打算去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where to now, Riddick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.70,2:00:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 去他的 别告诉我 我不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Fuck that. Don't tell me. I don't wanna know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.45,2:00:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you this, Johns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.83,2:00:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人迟早都得回家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later, we all have to head home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.04,2:00:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉达尔 随时为我准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Dahl to keep it warm for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.05,2:00:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Johns, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.80,2:00:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个虎父\N{\fnArial\fs30}you keep a strong spine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.35,2:01:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vaako.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.31,2:01:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着 告诉我他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are still alive. Tell me where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.90,2:01:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经不在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's no longer among us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.82,2:01:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 我会先杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, and I'll kill him first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.40,2:01:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You misunderstand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.20,2:01:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦可 是个正直且重视荣誉的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vaako is a decent man who meant to honor his word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.74,2:01:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕是跟你在一起 很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with you, strangely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.91,2:01:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不关心复仇星星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care about Furya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.66,2:01:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不关心你跟他之间的协定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what the pact was between you and him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.37,2:01:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡教派不容许出现异端\N{\fnArial\fs30}This faith cannot have a misbeliever{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.71,2:01:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者仁慈的领导者\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a kind heart leading it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.25,2:01:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经尽力去确保…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have done what I have done to ensure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.27,2:01:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,太啰嗦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.91,2:02:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别对我撒谎 我就不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never lie to me, I'll never hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.91,2:02:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}One word answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.75,2:02:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦可 是死是活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Vaako alive or dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.76,2:02:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both.{\r}
